h only the "},{"type":"element","tagName":"code","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"started"}]},{"type":"text","value":" activity type is supported, specifying the activity type will keep your workflow specific if more activity types are added in the future. For information about each activity type, see "},{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"/en/webhooks/webhook-events-and-payloads#watch"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Webhook events and payloads"}]},{"type":"text","value":". By default, all activity types trigger workflows that run on this event. You can limit your workflow runs to specific activity types using the "},{"type":"element","tagName":"code","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"types"}]},{"type":"text","value":" keyword. For more information, see "},{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"/en/actions/reference/workflows-and-actions/workflow-syntax#onevent_nametypes"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Workflow syntax for GitHub Actions"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"This event will only trigger a workflow run if the workflow file exists on the default branch."}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"p","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Runs your workflow when the workflow's repository is starred. For information about the pull request APIs, see "},{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"/en/graphql/reference/activity#mutation-addstar"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Activity"}]},{"type":"text","value":" in the GraphQL API documentation or "},{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"/en/rest/activity/starring"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"REST API endpoints for starring"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},